--- The default identity file in ~/.ssh
Using the SSH key from $HOME/.ssh/id_ed25519.
1
--- A dead ssh-agent socket does not prevent an explicit key file from being used
1
--- An unset IdentityAgent environment variable does not prevent an explicit key file from being used
1
--- The ed25519 key in the ssh-agent
Using the SSH key 'the ed25519 key' from the ssh-agent.
1
--- A global IdentityAgent expands an environment variable
Using the SSH key 'the ed25519 key' from the ssh-agent.
1
--- A matching IdentityAgent none disables an available ssh-agent
Using the SSH key from $HOME/.ssh/id_rsa.
1
--- The rsa key in the ssh-agent, with nothing in ~/.ssh
Using the SSH key 'the rsa key' from the ssh-agent.
1
